!.env.example
# `.env.*` above also swallows the *.example templates, and `!.env.example` is
# an exact match that does not rescue them. Without this line
# `.env.preview.example` is untrackable and the preview stack ships with no
# documented key list — while the real `.env.preview` stays ignored, which is
# the part that matters. Add a sibling line for any future *.example template.
!.env.preview.example

